{"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.046511627815782663,"w":0.069958845774332645,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.5,"t":"1718867188","x":0.77160493914987061},{"h":0.015029536540432376,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.053531743342372873,"w":0.11329394022623694,"x":0.11516372936421194,"c":1},{"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.098600815906358608,"w":0.057776832580566401,"x":0.11514450542166313,"h":0.010647205357276368,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.11522633691492781,"w":0.041152264277140305,"y":0.11337209289791039,"t":"JACK:","h":0.010174418787512574},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.11522633750496321,"y":0.15552325559318225,"c":1,"w":0.057613169352213542},{"t":"JACK:","x":0.11728394985293931,"y":0.17151162780438278,"w":0.039094651540120443,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.11728395161004963,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.21366279058080773,"h":0.010174418787512463,"w":0.055555553436279312},{"y":0.22815320628688907,"h":0.0088098664165806584,"t":"JACK:","w":0.03913422584533692,"c":1,"x":0.11726416276961875},{"y":0.27159846493250994,"w":0.057775414784749346,"x":0.11514521431956548,"h":0.012035628230046558,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"w":0.42798355102539065,"t":"The only problem is that the kids are back to school then.","x":0.20781892396482174,"c":1,"y":0.097383720822696418,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"x":0.20781892868393961,"h":0.011778563015312105,"w":0.56378601074218759,"c":1,"y":0.11189634877391119,"t":"I know. But one good thing about Irish summers is that it doesn't get too hot."},{"y":0.12632508820641342,"w":0.57613169352213545,"c":1,"x":0.20781892679355601,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"The average temperature is about 19 degrees and it usually doesn't go above"},{"t":"25 degrees.","c":1,"w":0.093077748616536449,"y":0.14135453268686804,"h":0.011340005378139062,"x":0.20752468456523848},{"h":0.013119208377438185,"x":0.20979586099387545,"y":0.15402233109023789,"w":0.32527717590332028,"c":1,"t":"That sounds alright. Now what about costs?"},{"c":1,"t":"Surfing is a pretty cheap holiday really - the only cost is the hire of equipment.","x":0.20987654811274239,"y":0.16860465104248878,"w":0.57818929036458333,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"y":0.18313953477678591,"x":0.20781893211442604,"t":"You can expect to pay a daily rate of about 30 euros for the hire of a wetsuit and","w":0.59670781453450517,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"board - but you can save about 40 euros if you hire by the week.","x":0.2078189409028291,"w":0.48353907267252599,"h":0.011778563015312216,"y":0.1975853948525419},{"w":0.14045393625895181,"y":0.21211401457545653,"c":1,"t":"That's not too bad.","x":0.20960842171070776,"h":0.01327196981656964},{"w":0.58024693806966143,"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.20987653085139538,"c":1,"y":0.2267373377943096,"t":"No. It's important to make sure you get good quality wetsuits - you'll all get too"},{"x":0.20781893401412513,"c":1,"w":0.58436213175455731,"y":0.24116607778845489,"t":"cold if you don't. And make sure you also get boots. They keep your feet warm","h":0.011778563015312105},{"h":0.013953202183591973,"c":1,"w":0.29032936096191408,"y":0.25354248899021614,"t":"and it's easier to surf with them on too.","x":0.20774285282141572},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"t":"OK. Well, thanks very much ...","y":0.27031802128227334,"x":0.20987653813762899,"w":0.22633745829264326},{"h":0.014849259519183922,"y":0.31524978881515497,"c":1,"w":0.096801528930664099,"t":"PART 2","x":0.11723709550103562},{"x":0.11522632540971282,"c":1,"y":0.34156976732223032,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Good afternoon. My name's Mrs Carter and I run the before and after school extended hours","w":0.68930043538411467},{"w":0.69135803222656256,"c":1,"x":0.11728394674804056,"t":"childcare service. I hope you've had a chance to have a good look around the school and talk","h":0.011778563015312216,"y":0.35747938772195642},{"h":0.013081395583944833,"w":0.69135803222656256,"y":0.37063953476348654,"x":0.117283946725719,"c":1,"t":"to staff and pupils. I know that many of you are interested in using our childcare service when"},{"c":1,"y":0.38515901084629867,"t":"your child joins the school, and perhaps you already know something about it, but for those","h":0.014550291607320909,"x":0.11522632730494176,"w":0.67695475260416671},{"t":"that don't, I'Il go through the main details now.","y":0.39958775028982529,"c":1,"x":0.11728395316560997,"w":0.34362139383951823,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"h":0.013774742086026359,"t":"We offer childcare for children from the ages of four to eleven both before and after school. I","x":0.11725251145311508,"y":0.42004037303146502,"w":0.68320587158203128,"c":1},{"t":"know that many parents who work find this service invaluable. You can leave your child with","h":0.016349949741251146,"y":0.43311378206175277,"x":0.11722212468272157,"c":1,"w":0.67913406372070317},{"h":0.015494207892176259,"t":"us safe in the knowledge that they will be extremely well cared for.","y":0.44903632013240857,"x":0.11722498888378567,"w":0.49188283284505202,"c":1},{"x":0.11522634016212492,"y":0.47232037672889193,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.64814814249674479,"t":"We are insured to provide care for up to 70 children, although we rarely have this many"},{"t":"attending at any one session. I think we generally expect around 50-60 children for the","h":0.013788066567464785,"y":0.48508899255873139,"c":1,"w":0.64617945353190098,"x":0.11723535984508658},{"t":"afternoon sessions and about half that number for the breakfast sessions. Although we","x":0.11517655366654803,"h":0.015756936741661565,"c":1,"w":0.64413736979166669,"y":0.49889358658933614},{"c":1,"t":"currently do have 70 children registered with us, not all of these attend every day. It's ten","w":0.65637858072916666,"x":0.11728396056304594,"y":0.51590106023854609,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"x":0.1172839477219865,"t":"years since we began offering an extended hours service and we've come a long way during","w":0.68518519083658858,"y":0.52906976732155853,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.54358068337504672,"t":"that time. When we first opened, we only had about 20 children attending regularly.","x":0.11728394983704088,"w":0.615226338704427,"h":0.013250883392226243},{"w":0.64609054565429691,"t":"We try to keep our costs as low as we can and we think we provide very good value for","y":0.56537102457634392,"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.11728394517494943,"c":1},{"t":"money. For the afternoon sessions, which run from 3.30 until 6 p.m., it's £7.20. But if you","h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.11728396056658018,"c":1,"w":0.65637858072916666,"y":0.57979976457030236},{"x":0.11728395145865733,"c":1,"t":"prefer, you can pay for one hour only, which costs £3.50, or two hours which costs £5.70.","y":0.59447674405305617,"w":0.66049382527669276,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"x":0.11728394767614664,"t":"The cost of the childcare includes food and snacks. They'll be given breakfast in the morning","y":0.61627906966097878,"c":1,"w":0.68518519083658846},{"h":0.011778563015312216,"y":0.63074204925894739,"w":0.66255142211914053,"c":1,"x":0.11728395961368639,"t":"and in the afternoon, a healthy snack as soon as they finish school. At 5 p.m. children are"},{"t":"given something more substantial, such as pasta or a casserole. Please inform us of any","x":0.11517199551139404,"y":0.64344176027743949,"h":0.015016231154946214,"w":0.66058746337890628,"c":1},{"h":0.01308995562532056,"y":0.65842167239177718,"w":0.68724278767903646,"c":1,"x":0.11728395611137955,"t":"allergies that your child might have and we'll make sure they're offered a suitable alternative."},{"y":0.6802120141436625,"w":0.64814814249674479,"h":0.013101939458588618,"c":1,"t":"As you may know, the childcare service runs through the school holidays from 8 a.m. to","x":0.11728395336495813},{"x":0.1172839558459422,"c":1,"h":0.010306242638398078,"t":"6 p.m. We offer a really varied and exciting programme to keep the children entertained - we","y":0.69611307395515787,"w":0.68724278767903646},{"c":1,"t":"don't want them to feel as if they are still at school! It will also feel different because they'll","w":0.66460906982421875,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.70930232547441863,"x":0.11728394232444582},{"c":1,"t":"get the chance to make new friends with children from other schools - spaces are available","h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.72379269709221239,"w":0.6769547526041666,"x":0.11728394051148504},{"t":"for them because a lot of our term-time children don't always attend during the holiday. In the","y":0.73837209291698014,"w":0.68930043538411456,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.11728393858082256},{"t":"past, parents have asked if children over the age of 11 are allowed to come with their younger","h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"w":0.69341562906901044,"y":0.75290697663682971,"x":0.11934156805129627},{"x":0.1172839395168693,"t":"brothers and sisters - but I'm afraid we're unable to do this because of the type of insurance","y":0.76737338058921511,"w":0.68312759399414058,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1},{"t":"we have.","c":1,"w":0.07245540618896483,"x":0.11711457495541448,"y":0.78179312201054707,"h":0.011396148600763545},{"y":0.470930232414423,"w":0.0576131693522135,"c":1,"t":"Q11\/12","x":0.83539094608932529,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.057613169352213611,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.83539094608902054,"t":"Q11\/12","c":1,"y":0.48546511615304433},{"c":1,"t":"Q13","y":0.57994186032642436,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.83333333394292997,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"c":1,"w":0.039250745773315554,"x":0.83232581253296523,"h":0.014494940866710659,"t":"Q14","y":0.62876896918414571},{"w":0.037037035624186143,"c":1,"x":0.83333333394292997,"t":"Q15","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.72383720914629712},{"t":"So now let me tell you about some of the activities that your child can do during the after-","y":0.82267441849827738,"w":0.65843622843424487,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"x":0.11934155645822746},{"y":0.83716136629996141,"t":"school sessions. As well as being able to use the playground equipment, computers and","x":0.11728395209796086,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.65432098388671878},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.86773255798110183,"x":0.11522633805210442,"w":0.037037035624186199,"t":"108"},{"w":0.30619837443033859,"x":0.66984496081179823,"h":0.035152653221247165,"c":1,"y":0.95314993691982619,"t":"IELTSXpress.com"}],"h":3395}